# Opinion

Meeting: 0026-ensure-calendar-sync-basic-auth-and-cloud
Agent: Critic
Task: ensure calendar sync basic auth and cloud
Context:
- Basic-auth sync path was introduced alongside manual sync UI and remote adapter tweaks; OIDC remains the bearer-token path.
- Remote sync failures now fall back to local operation instead of blocking the app.
Position:
- Overwriting local state with remote snapshots could hide conflicting edits; no merge or conflict indicator exists yet.
- Status messages are rendered via escaped HTML, so login links remain plain text (may limit usability).
Recommendations:
- Add guardrails or prompts before replacing local data during manual sync if local changes diverge.
- Evaluate whether status rendering should allow safe links for auth prompts or a dedicated banner.
- Monitor Basic auth token handling to ensure secrets are not logged or persisted beyond storage scoping.
